{"text": "In the morning Johnsy told Sue to pull up the shade. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After the beating rain and fierce wind, one ivy leaf still hung against the brick wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was dark green near the stem and yellow at the edges. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The leaf stayed there all day, and it was still there through the second stormy night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have been a bad girl, Sudie, said Johnsy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Something has made that last leaf stay there to show me how wicked I was. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is wrong to want to die, she said, and she asked for some soup. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next day the doctor said, She is out of danger, and you have won. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But there is sad news, too, he added, Old Behrman has pneumonia, and there is no hope for him.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "J", "o", "h", "n", "s", "y", " ", "t", "o", "l", "d", " ", "S", "u", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "p", "u", "l", "l", " ", "u", "p", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "a", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "r", "a", "i", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "i", "e", "r", "c", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", ",", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "i", "v", "y", " ", "l", "e", "a", "f", " ", "s", "t", "i", "l", "l", " ", "h", "u", "n", "g", " ", "a", "g", "a", "i", "n", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "r", "i", "c", "k", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", " ", "g", "r", "e", "e", "n", " ", "n", "e", "a", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "e", "m", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "y", "e", "l", "l", "o"